From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lutvzn <106083845+lutvzn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:53:12 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] qualcommax: ipq50xx: redmi-ax3000: turn off ECM fraglist
 GRO

The same 256 MiB setting as on the CR8806, same hardware: NSS forwards
established flows, but the fraglist segments of the first packets of
each flow leave order-3 kmalloc-4k slabs half used, so several MiB stay
pinned after each burst of new flows.
---
 .../ipq50xx/base-files/etc/uci-defaults/15_cr8806_ecm_gro_list  | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/uci-defaults/15_cr8806_ecm_gro_list b/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/uci-defaults/15_cr8806_ecm_gro_list
index 921c450001..68998f7c46 100644
--- a/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/uci-defaults/15_cr8806_ecm_gro_list
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommax/ipq50xx/base-files/etc/uci-defaults/15_cr8806_ecm_gro_list
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
 . /lib/functions.sh
 
 case "$(board_name)" in
-xiaomi,cr8806|xiaomi,redmi-ax3000-ubootmod) ;;
+xiaomi,cr8806|xiaomi,redmi-ax3000|xiaomi,redmi-ax3000-ubootmod) ;;
 *) exit 0 ;;
 esac
 uci -q get ecm.general > /dev/null || exit 0
